      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اقاح</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>kept constantly,</i> or
<i>perseveringly, to refusing, after the act of asking,</i>
or <i>begging;</i> (K, TA;) mentioned by IAar, but
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قيح</span>. (TA.)

